  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/znHQQtuU/images/653b6f24f05341edcd3cba3164edd0b8d2c0dd71.png\" alt=\"更多佳餚\" width=\"408\" height=\"111\"></p><p><strong>展開一場豐盛的烹飪之旅</strong>，透過 More Delight 模組（適用於 Farmer's Delight）增添更多菜餚、刀具與食材。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-delight-forge/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/to1Ri2x.png\" alt=\"下載更新\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-delight-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KXy6vrX.png\" alt=\"Fabric 下載\" width=\"174\" height=\"36\"></a></p><h2>🍽️ 特色功能</h2><ul>\n<li>透過新菜餚與食材擴展你的菜單。</li>\n<li>使用麵包片輕鬆製作三明治。</li>\n<li>享用由麵包片製成的酥脆吐司。</li>\n<li>裝備木製與石製刀具，享受精準的烹飪體驗。</li>\n</ul><h2>🛠️ 相容模組</h2><ul>\n<li>Expanded Delight</li>\n<li>Casualness Delight</li>\n<li>Supplementaries</li>\n<li>Create</li>\n<li>Some Assembly Required</li>\n</ul><p>許多菜餚的靈感來自於我的女友親手烹調的美味佳餚。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"為筆電存錢中！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"贊助我\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"捐款按鈕\"></a></p>",
